      │        └─ source partsupp AS partsupp use-filter 1 keys=[partsupp.ps_suppkey] (rows≈10 cost≈200)
      └─ project (__scalar_0__) (rows≈1 cost≈9K)
         └─ aggregate keys=[__group__] aggs=[sum_0=sum] (rows≈1 cost≈9K)
            └─ project (arg_0, __group__) (rows≈1 cost≈9K)
               └─ join inner [supplier_1.s_suppkey = partsupp_1.ps_suppkey] emit-filter 3 from left (rows≈1 cost≈9K)
